      "translationRaw": "AfterthesetentornwearisomeyearsWehavemetagain。WewerebothsochangedThathearingfirstyoursurname，Ithoughtyouastranger--Thenhearingyourgivenname，Irememberedyouryoungface。。。。AllthathashappenedwiththetidesWehavetoldandtoldtilltheeveningbell。。。。TomorrowyoujourneytoYouzhou，Leavingautumnbetweenus，peakafterpeak。",
